DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uummss driver provides support for USB HID mice, touchscreens and digi‐
     tisers.  Access to these devices is through the wscons(4) driver.

     If the touchscreen sensor is poorly aligned, then xtsscale(1) should be
     used to provide calibration results to the uummss driver.

SSEEEE AALLSSOO
     xtsscale(1), uhidev(4), usb(4), wsmouse(4)

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The uummss driver first appeared in OpenBSD 2.8.

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     HID touchscreen and digitiser support was written by Robert Nagy and
     Matthieu Herrb then later merged into the generic uummss driver by Edd
     Barrett.

CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     Touchscreen and digitiser pressure sensitivity is not yet implemented.

